---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ContentPendingNotice from "@/components/ContentPendingNotice.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Aaron Joseph Hall — pastor, husband, father, and author, doing digital media work in website development & hosting and content + copywriting."
  path="/about"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl md:text-5xl">About Aaron</h1>

    <div class="prose-article mt-10">
      <ContentPendingNotice variant="ai-draft" />

      <p>
        I'm a pastor by calling and a writer by compulsion — I tend to think in sentences whether
        I'm standing in front of a congregation, sitting across from someone in crisis, or just
        trying to figure out what I actually believe about something. Most of what I write comes
        out of that same instinct: not theory first, but a real question from a real week, worked
        out slowly until it says something true.
      </p>

      <p>
        Before any of that, I'm a husband and a father, and that's not a footnote — it's most of
        what actually shapes how I lead and what I write about. The people who watch me most
        closely aren't a congregation or an audience; they're my own family, and I'd rather be
        honest about that tension than perform a version of leadership that doesn't survive
        contact with home.
      </p>

      <p>
        This site is my ministry blog — writing on life, faith, family, ministry, and technology,
        the ordinary and the eternal both. Alongside that, I do digital media work: website
        development &amp; hosting, and content + copywriting for churches, ministries, and
        organizations that need a site built well and words written with care.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you're here for the writing, you'll find essays on life, faith, family, and ministry.
        If you're here about working together on a website or content, you'll find that too.
        Either way — thanks for being here.
      </p>

      <p class="content-pending-notice not-prose">
        <strong>Needs your input:</strong> I deliberately left out specifics I can't verify —
        church name, city, family details, timeline, credentials. Drop those in (or just rewrite
        the whole thing) and I'll wire it in exactly as you give it to me.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
